---
import Layout from 'src/layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - SplitDo">
	<main class="min-h-screen bg-white dark:bg-gray-900">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
			<div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
				<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

				<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8">
					<strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 1, 2025<br>
					<strong>Last Updated:</strong> January 1, 2025
				</p>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">1. Introduction</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
						SplitDo ("we," "our," or "us") is a blockchain-based financial splitting application that helps users manage shared expenses with friends and groups. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our mobile application and related services.
					</p>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						By using SplitDo, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">2. Developer Information</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						<strong>Company:</strong> SplitDo Inc.<br>
						<strong>Contact Email:</strong> privacy@splitdo.com<br>
						<strong>Address:</strong> [Your Business Address]<br>
						<strong>Privacy Officer:</strong> privacy@splitdo.com
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">3. Information We Collect</h2>

					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">3.1 Personal Information</h3>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
						<li>Account information (username, email address)</li>
						<li>Profile information (display name, profile picture)</li>
						<li>Contact information for connecting with friends</li>
						<li>Financial transaction data (expense amounts, descriptions, categories)</li>
						<li>Device information (device ID, operating system, app version)</li>
					</ul>

					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">3.2 Blockchain and Wallet Data</h3>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
						<li>Blockchain wallet addresses (publicly visible on blockchain)</li>
						<li>Transaction hashes and blockchain transaction data</li>
						<li>Private keys (stored locally on your device only - we never access or store private keys)</li>
						<li>Cryptocurrency balance information</li>
					</ul>

					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">3.3 Usage Data</h3>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						<li>App usage analytics and performance data</li>
						<li>Error logs and crash reports</li>
						<li>Feature usage statistics</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">4. How We Use Your Information</h2>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						<li>Provide and maintain our expense splitting services</li>
						<li>Process and track shared expenses and settlements</li>
						<li>Enable peer-to-peer connections and group management</li>
						<li>Facilitate blockchain transactions for settlements</li>
						<li>Improve app functionality and user experience</li>
						<li>Provide customer support and respond to inquiries</li>
						<li>Send important notifications about your account and transactions</li>
						<li>Comply with legal obligations and prevent fraud</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">5. Blockchain and Cryptocurrency Considerations</h2>

					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">5.1 Non-Custodial Wallet</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
						SplitDo operates as a non-custodial wallet application. Your private keys are generated and stored locally on your device. We never have access to, store, or transmit your private keys. You maintain full control and responsibility for your cryptocurrency assets.
					</p>

					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">5.2 Blockchain Transparency</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
						All blockchain transactions are publicly visible on the respective blockchain networks. While wallet addresses may be pseudonymous, transaction data including amounts and addresses are permanently recorded on public blockchains.
					</p>

					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">5.3 Transaction Data</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						We may associate blockchain transactions with expense splitting activities within the app to provide transaction history and settlement tracking features.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">6. Information Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
						We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information in the following circumstances:
					</p>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						<li><strong>With Other Users:</strong> When you participate in shared expenses, other group members can see relevant transaction details</li>
						<li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> With trusted third-party services that help us operate the app (analytics, cloud storage, customer support)</li>
						<li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by law, regulation, or legal process</li>
						<li><strong>Safety and Security:</strong> To protect our users, app, or others from fraud or illegal activities</li>
						<li><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In case of merger, acquisition, or sale of assets</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">7. Data Security and Protection</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
						We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your information:
					</p>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						<li>End-to-end encryption for sensitive data transmission</li>
						<li>Secure local storage of private keys on your device</li>
						<li>Regular security audits and updates</li>
						<li>Access controls and authentication requirements</li>
						<li>Monitoring for unauthorized access and suspicious activities</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">8. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
						Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal information:
					</p>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						<li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you</li>
						<li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information</li>
						<li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your personal information (subject to legal requirements)</li>
						<li><strong>Portability:</strong> Request transfer of your data to another service</li>
						<li><strong>Opt-out:</strong> Unsubscribe from marketing communications</li>
						<li><strong>Restrict Processing:</strong> Request limitation of how we process your information</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mt-4">
						To exercise these rights, contact us at privacy@splitdo.com.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">9. Age Restrictions</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						SplitDo is intended for users aged 18 and older. We do not knowingly collect personal information from individuals under 18. If you are under 18, please do not use our services or provide any personal information.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">10. International Data Transfers</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						Your information may be transferred to and processed in countries other than your own. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place to protect your information in accordance with applicable data protection laws.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">11. Third-Party Services</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
						Our app may contain links to third-party websites or integrate with third-party services. This Privacy Policy does not apply to these external services. We recommend reviewing the privacy policies of any third-party services you use.
					</p>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						We may use third-party analytics services to understand app usage and improve our services. These services may collect information about your use of the app.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">12. Data Retention</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						We retain your personal information for as long as necessary to provide our services and comply with legal obligations. Account information and transaction history may be retained even after account deletion for legal and regulatory compliance purposes.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">13. Financial Compliance</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						As a financial application, we may be required to comply with anti-money laundering (AML) and know-your-customer (KYC) regulations. This may include verifying user identities and monitoring transactions for suspicious activities.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">14. Updates to This Privacy Policy</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any material changes by posting the new Privacy Policy in the app and updating the "Last Updated" date. Your continued use of the app after changes constitute acceptance of the updated policy.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">15. Contact Us</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
						If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us:
					</p>
					<div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg">
						<p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
							<strong>Email:</strong> privacy@splitdo.com<br>
							<strong>Subject Line:</strong> Privacy Policy Inquiry<br>
							<strong>Response Time:</strong> We aim to respond within 30 days
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>

				<div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-orange-50 dark:bg-orange-900/20 border border-orange-200 dark:border-orange-800 rounded-lg">
					<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-orange-800 dark:text-orange-200 mb-2">Important Notice</h3>
					<p class="text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-300 text-sm">
						This privacy policy is designed to comply with Google Play Store requirements for financial and cryptocurrency applications. By using SplitDo, you acknowledge that you understand the risks associated with cryptocurrency transactions and blockchain technology.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>